<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/NvdSsvcOption> a linkml:ClassDefinition ;
	skos:inScheme "https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/nvd_cve"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:note "NVD's file allows any key, with a string or a list of strings as its value, and extra_slots states that. The real data holds one key per object, and only these three, each with a string. They are named here because LinkML's Pydantic generator ignores extra_slots, so without them the Pydantic model refuses every SSVC decision." ;
