d/NvdSsvcData> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/NvdSsvcDecisionTree> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/NvdSsvcMetricV203> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/NvdSsvcOption> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/NvdVendorComment> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/NvdVersionChange> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/NvdVulnerability> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/NvdWeakness> ;
	linkml:default_prefix "nist_nvd" ;
	linkml:default_range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/string> ;
	linkml:description "A LinkML model of the JSON responses of the NVD API 2.0, from the JSON schemas NIST publishes: vulnerabilities, products, match strings and change history. NVD's own keys are the schema's keys, so a real response validates unchanged." ;
